{"4795070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UNHOLD", "steam_appid": 4795070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795070/extras/604de45f5b01eeb36897d6c50f99fad5.poster.avif?t=1781270409\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795070/extras/604de45f5b01eeb36897d6c50f99fad5.webm?t=1781270409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795070/extras/604de45f5b01eeb36897d6c50f99fad5.mp4?t=1781270409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNHOLD</strong> is a rock climbing simulator built with Unreal Engine 5, played from a third-person perspective.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game is designed for those seeking a calm, focused experience that requires patience, precision, and an understanding of physics. This is not a fast-paced action game or a puzzle game in the classical sense.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795070/extras/723cb536b1a7c83fbc373c0aca31a4e3.poster.avif?t=1781270409\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795070/extras/723cb536b1a7c83fbc373c0aca31a4e3.webm?t=1781270409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795070/extras/723cb536b1a7c83fbc373c0aca31a4e3.mp4?t=1781270409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op for up to four players. Gather all your friends and conquer every peak!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new height, an increasingly wide panorama unfolds: distant mountains, rivers, clouds beneath your feet. The game features a day and night cycle that affects the lighting of the rocks and surroundings. UNHOLD allows you to fully immerse yourself in the nature of the mountains.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saving</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is automatically saved upon reaching checkpoints, which are located on natural ledges of the cliffs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Game Modes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main mode features checkpoints — suitable for getting familiar with the game before attempting a record run. The mode with saves provides checkpoints for practicing difficult sections without having to restart from the beginning. Hardcore mode has no saves — any fall means death, and the climb starts from the very beginning.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The global leaderboard ranks players by total ascent time and distance climbed. Each entry includes a ghost of the record run available for viewing.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795070/extras/604de45f5b01eeb36897d6c50f99fad5.poster.avif?t=1781270409\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795070/extras/604de45f5b01eeb36897d6c50f99fad5.webm?t=1781270409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset